{
  "model": "<section id=\"model\"><p class=\"index\">01 / THE UNIT</p><div class=\"section-head\"><h2 data-i18n-html=\"modelTitle\">不是总结论文。<br>是拆出可检查的知识单元。</h2><p data-i18n=\"modelIntro\">论文保留为来源容器，Claim–Evidence–Conclusion 才是可搜索、可比较、可质疑的知识节点。</p></div><div class=\"units\"><article><span>01 / CLAIM</span><h3 data-i18n=\"claimQuestion\">论文究竟提出什么？</h3><p data-i18n=\"claimExplain\">一句可以被证据支持、收窄或反驳的命题。</p></article><article><span>02 / EVIDENCE</span><h3 data-i18n=\"evidenceQuestion\">它凭什么这样说？</h3><p data-i18n=\"evidenceExplain\">方法、数据、理论，以及真正的独立证据单位。</p></article><article class=\"conclusion\"><span>03 / CONCLUSION</span><h3 data-i18n=\"conclusionTitle\">结果必须连同边界保存。</h3><div><p><b>Positive</b><span data-i18n=\"positiveShort\">实际支持什么</span></p><p><b>Boundary</b><span data-i18n=\"boundaryShort\">在哪些条件成立</span></p><p><b>Negative</b><span data-i18n=\"negativeShort\">什么未成立或不可推出</span></p><p><b>Unresolved</b><span data-i18n=\"unresolvedShort\">仍未回答什么</span></p></div></article></div><aside class=\"rule\"><b data-i18n=\"ruleTitle\">粗分类负责找到方向；具体 claim 负责回答问题。</b><span data-i18n=\"ruleText\">同属一个问题只表示值得比较，不自动表示复现、支持或矛盾。</span></aside></section>",
  "library": "<section id=\"library\"><p class=\"index\">03 / CLAIM LIBRARY</p><div class=\"section-head library-head\"><h2 data-i18n-html=\"libraryTitle\">从方向找路，<br>从论文看全貌，从问题查证据。</h2><div class=\"stats\"><b><strong id=\"papers\">—</strong><span data-i18n=\"papersUnit\">论文</span></b><b><strong id=\"claims\">—</strong>CLAIMS</b><b><strong id=\"curated\">—</strong><span data-i18n=\"curatedUnit\">人工核验</span></b></div></div><div class=\"notice\"><b data-i18n=\"curationTitle\">分层说明</b><span data-i18n=\"curationText\">同一个知识库包含人工策展、全文候选和仅元数据记录；状态不等于真值，候选不会自动进入问题关系。</span></div><div class=\"tabs\"><button class=\"active\" data-mode=\"directions\" data-i18n=\"tabDirections\">01 按方向</button><button data-mode=\"papers\" data-i18n=\"tabPapers\">02 按论文</button><button data-mode=\"questions\" data-i18n=\"tabQuestions\">03 按问题</button><button data-mode=\"graph\" data-i18n=\"tabGraph\">04 逻辑图</button></div><p class=\"result-note\"><span class=\"ex-zh\">上方为全库总量；下方为当前筛选。状态属于单条记录，方向可以重叠。</span><span class=\"ex-en\">Totals above describe the whole library; results below use your filters. Status belongs to individual records; directions can overlap.</span></p><div class=\"filters\"><label><span>SEARCH THE EVIDENCE</span><input id=\"search\" data-i18n-placeholder=\"searchPlaceholder\" placeholder=\"搜索观点、论文、方法或问题\"></label><label><span>DIRECTION</span><select id=\"direction\"></select></label><label><span>RECORD STATUS</span><select id=\"record-status\"></select></label><label><span><span class=\"ex-zh\">排序</span><span class=\"ex-en\">SORT</span></span><select id=\"result-sort\"></select></label></div><div id=\"search-summary\" class=\"search-summary\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"workspace\"><div id=\"results\"></div><aside id=\"detail\"><div class=\"empty\"><span>SELECT A RECORD</span><h3 data-i18n-html=\"emptyTitle\">先找到问题，<br>再检查证据。</h3><p data-i18n=\"emptyText\">选择方向、论文、claim 或科学问题查看完整证据契约。</p></div></aside></div></section>",
  "join": "<section id=\"join\" class=\"join\"><p class=\"index\">04 / OPEN CURATION</p><div><h2 data-i18n-html=\"joinTitle\">不用再写一整个宇宙。<br>先把一条知识说完整。</h2><p data-i18n=\"joinText\">从一篇熟悉的论文提取一条完整 claim，补齐一个边界，或核查两条 claim 是否真的构成复现、反驳或收窄。</p><div class=\"join-cards\"><article><span>01</span><b data-i18n=\"joinCurateTitle\">策展一篇论文</b><p data-i18n=\"joinCurateText\">提取或核验一条完整的 Claim–Evidence–Conclusion。</p></article><article><span>02</span><b data-i18n=\"joinRelationTitle\">核验一条关系</b><p data-i18n=\"joinRelationText\">判断两项工作构成支持、复现、反驳还是收窄。</p></article><article><span>03</span><b data-i18n=\"joinBuildTitle\">一起建设工具</b><p data-i18n=\"joinBuildText\">改进数据标准、交互、审查流程或开放治理。</p></article></div><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"mailto:tongtonghmy@gmail.com?subject=Join%20Claim%20Commons\" data-i18n=\"contactMe\">联系我：tongtonghmy@gmail.com ↗</a><a class=\"button\" href=\"https://github.com/Mia9469/ClaimCommons/issues/new/choose\" data-i18n=\"submitClaim\">提交一条 claim ↗</a><a class=\"button\" href=\"helix.html\" data-i18n=\"legacyAtlas\">查看旧版 Atlas ↗</a></div></div></section>",
  "guestbook": "<section id=\"guestbook\" class=\"guestbook\"><p class=\"index\">05 / OPEN GUESTBOOK</p><div class=\"guestbook-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">JOIN THE CONVERSATION</p><h2 data-i18n-html=\"guestbookTitle\">想听听你的想法。<br><em>也欢迎不同意见。</em></h2><p data-i18n=\"guestbookText\">Claim Commons 仍是一个早期实验。哪些定义不准确？哪些边界被遗漏？欢迎留下想法、建议、质疑或批评。</p><p class=\"guestbook-note\" data-i18n=\"guestbookNote\">留言公开保存在 GitHub，需要 GitHub 账号发布。</p></div><div class=\"guestbook-comments\"><p class=\"guestbook-component-note\"><span class=\"ex-zh\">下方留言组件暂使用英文：Write 是撰写，Preview 是预览，Sign in with GitHub 是登录。若组件无法加载，也可使用邮件或 GitHub 留言入口。</span><span class=\"ex-en\">The comment component below uses English. If it does not load, use email or the GitHub guestbook instead.</span></p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"https://github.com/Mia9469/ClaimCommons/issues?q=is%3Aissue%20label%3Aguestbook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"ex-zh\">在 GitHub 查看留言</span><span class=\"ex-en\">Open guestbook on GitHub</span></a><a class=\"button\" href=\"mailto:tongtonghmy@gmail.com?subject=Claim%20Commons%20feedback\"><span class=\"ex-zh\">用邮件反馈</span><span class=\"ex-en\">Send feedback by email</span></a></div><script src=\"https://utteranc.es/client.js\" repo=\"Mia9469/ClaimCommons\" issue-term=\"Claim Commons Guestbook / 留言板\" label=\"guestbook\" theme=\"github-light\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" async></script><noscript>Please enable JavaScript to view the guestbook.</noscript></div></div></section>"
}
